('wikiloc', '54869027', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/neveron-de-urriellu-torre-de-la-pardida-y-cuetos-del-trave-54869027', 'Urriellu Snowdrift, La Párdida Peak, and Cuetos del Trave', '{"en":"La Párdida and Cuetos del Trave one way","ca":"La Párdida i Cuetos del Trave un sol sentit","es":"La Párdida y Cuetos del Trave un solo sentido"}'::jsonb, 'Neverón de Urriellu, Torre de La Párdida y Cuetos del Trave Hiking trail in Sotres, Asturias (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Pandébano - Ref. Urriellu - Hda. Arenera - Neverón de Urriellu - Torre de La Párdida - Cuetos del Trave - Ref. Cabrones', '{"en":"This challenging one-way route traverses the Picos de Europa, linking Pandébano to Refugio de Cabrones. The trail ascends to Refugio Urriellu and Horcada Arenera before tackling the summits of Neverón de Urriellu, Torre de La Párdida, and Cuetos del Trave.\n\nThis is a long and demanding journey with significant elevation gain, suitable for experienced hikers comfortable with high mountain terrain and extended efforts. The route offers a comprehensive exploration of several prominent peaks in the central massif.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta d''una sola direcció travessa els Picos de Europa, connectant Pandébano amb el Refugi de Cabrones. El camí ascendeix al Refugi Urriellu i la Horcada Arenera abans d''abordar els cims del Neverón de Urriellu, la Torre de La Párdida i els Cuetos del Trave.\n\nÉs una travessa llarga i exigent amb un desnivell considerable, apta per a excursionistes experimentats acostumats al terreny d''alta muntanya i a esforços prolongats. La ruta ofereix una exploració completa de diversos cims prominents del massís central.","es":"Esta exigente ruta de ida atraviesa los Picos de Europa, conectando Pandébano con el Refugio de Cabrones. El sendero asciende al Refugio Urriellu y la Horcada Arenera antes de abordar las cumbres del Neverón de Urriellu, la Torre de La Párdida y los Cuetos del Trave.\n\nEs una travesía larga y exigente con un desnivel considerable, adecuada para montañistas experimentados acostumbrados al terreno de alta montaña y a esfuerzos prolongados. La ruta ofrece una exploración completa de varias cumbres prominentes del macizo central."}'::jsonb, 'Enrique Gonber', 17767, 2025, 1101, 2650, 1177, 'moderate', 'one-way', 27000, 72660, 3144, '2020-08-15', '2020-07', '[{"lat":43.232897,"lng":-4.778571,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232851,"lng":-4.778588,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232854,"lng":-4.778658,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232894,"lng":-4.778697,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232864,"lng":-4.778757,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232872,"lng":-4.778851,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232863,"lng":-4.778934,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232837,"lng":-4.779036,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232807,"lng":-4.779101,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232768,"lng":-4.779139,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232723,"lng":-4.779173,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232692,"lng":-4.77923,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232649,"lng":-4.779282,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232607,"lng":-4.779334,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232574,"lng":-4.779383,"ele":1177.3},{"lat":43.232591,"lng":-4.779452,"ele":1178.4},{"lat":43.232585,"lng":-4.779519,"ele":1178.2},{"lat":43.232585,"lng":-4.779582,"ele":1178.5},{"lat":43.232571,"lng":-4.779656,"ele":1177.9},{"lat":43.232569,"lng":-4.77972,"ele":1176.7},{"lat":43.232609,"lng":-4.779773,"ele":1177.2},{"lat":43.232652,"lng":-4.77981,"ele":1178.3},{"lat":43.232702,"lng":-4.779823,"ele":1179.8},{"lat":43.232726,"lng":-4.779876,"ele":1180.3},{"lat":43.232739,"lng":-4.779939,"ele":1182.2},{"lat":43.232781,"lng":-4.779975,"ele":1183.3},{"lat":43.232806,"lng":-4.780029,"ele":1184.4},{"lat":43.232838,"lng":-4.780082,"ele":1185},{"lat":43.232873,"lng":-4.780126,"ele":1185},{"lat":43.232897,"lng":-4.780187,"ele":1184.2},{"lat":43.232923,"lng":-4.780248,"ele":1182.5},{"lat":43.232932,"lng":-4.780311,"ele":1182.7},{"lat":43.232974,"lng":-4.780347,"ele":1183.6},{"lat":43.233003,"lng":-4.780399,"ele":1183.7},{"lat":43.233029,"lng":-4.7804