('wikiloc', '84883341', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/la-tesa-base-de-la-mesa-y-la-almagrera-84883341', 'La Tesa, Base of la Mesa, and La Almagrera', '{"en":"Shorter loop via Mesa and Almagrera","ca":"Circular curta per Mesa i Almagrera","es":"Circular corta por Mesa y Almagrera"}'::jsonb, 'La Tesa,base de la Mesa,y La Almagrera Hiking trail in El Campo, Asturias (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Bastante marcado el camino nada más salir del aparcamiento,luego por el cresterio volvemos a bajar siguiendo el track,y seguimos hacia la tesa sin dificultad en la subida', '{"en":"This loop route explores the peaks of La Tesa, the base of La Mesa, and La Almagrera, starting from a parking area. The path is quite well-marked from the outset, making route-finding straightforward.\n\nAfter an initial ascent, the trail follows a crest before descending and continuing towards La Tesa, which is reached without significant difficulty. This 10.3 km route with 557m of elevation gain is rated moderate, offering a clear and accessible mountain experience.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular explora els cims de La Tesa, la base de La Mesa i La Almagrera, començant des d''una zona d''aparcament. El camí està força ben marcat des del principi, facilitant la navegació.\n\nDesprés d''una pujada inicial, el sender segueix una cresta abans de baixar i continuar cap a La Tesa, a la qual s''arriba sense dificultat significativa. Aquesta ruta de 10,3 km amb 557m de desnivell positiu es classifica com a moderada, oferint una experiència de muntanya clara i accessible.","es":"Esta ruta circular explora los picos de La Tesa, la base de La Mesa y La Almagrera, partiendo de una zona de aparcamiento. El camino está bastante marcado desde el inicio, lo que facilita la orientación.\n\nTras un ascenso inicial, el sendero sigue una crestería antes de descender y continuar hacia La Tesa, a la que se llega sin dificultad. Esta ruta de 10,3 km con 557m de desnivel positivo está clasificada como moderada, ofreciendo una experiencia de montaña clara y accesible."}'::jsonb, 'roberyoa', 10348, 557, 568, 1930, 1664, 'moderate', 'loop', 10980, 14100, 1987, '2021-09-25', '2021-08', '[{"lat":42.990474,"lng":-5.905409,"ele":1691.5},{"lat":42.990434,"lng":-5.90538,"ele":1689.8},{"lat":42.990396,"lng":-5.905345,"ele":1689.3},{"lat":42.990405,"lng":-5.90528,"ele":1689.3},{"lat":42.990411,"lng":-5.90521,"ele":1689.3},{"lat":42.990438,"lng":-5.905155,"ele":1689.3},{"lat":42.990452,"lng":-5.905089,"ele":1689.3},{"lat":42.990463,"lng":-5.905024,"ele":1689.4},{"lat":42.99047,"lng":-5.904955,"ele":1689.6},{"lat":42.990486,"lng":-5.904892,"ele":1690.7},{"lat":42.990504,"lng":-5.904833,"ele":1692.3},{"lat":42.990506,"lng":-5.904769,"ele":1692.9},{"lat":42.990532,"lng":-5.904715,"ele":1692.9},{"lat":42.990543,"lng":-5.904648,"ele":1692.9},{"lat":42.990561,"lng":-5.904582,"ele":1692.6},{"lat":42.990557,"lng":-5.904508,"ele":1692},{"lat":42.990561,"lng":-5.904438,"ele":1691.6},{"lat":42.990559,"lng":-5.904376,"ele":1691.6},{"lat":42.990551,"lng":-5.904306,"ele":1691.6},{"lat":42.990566,"lng":-5.904241,"ele":1691.7},{"lat":42.990564,"lng":-5.904171,"ele":1692.4},{"lat":42.99058,"lng":-5.90411,"ele":1693.1},{"lat":42.990595,"lng":-5.904047,"ele":1694.2},{"lat":42.990603,"lng":-5.903979,"ele":1695.7},{"lat":42.990592,"lng":-5.903914,"ele":1697},{"lat":42.990598,"lng":-5.903844,"ele":1697.9},{"lat":42.9906,"lng":-5.903779,"ele":1698.1},{"lat":42.990612,"lng":-5.903718,"ele":1698.5},{"lat":42.990636,"lng":-5.903655,"ele":1698.9},{"lat":42.990658,"lng":-5.903601,"ele":1699.8},{"lat":42.990687,"lng":-5.903545,"ele":1700.8},{"lat":42.990718,"lng":-5.903494,"ele":1701.6},{"lat":42.990744,"lng":-5.90343,"ele":1702.5},{"lat":42.990782,"lng":-5.903386,"ele":1703.9},{"lat":42.990809,"lng":-5.903337,"ele":1705.4},{"lat":42.990831,"lng":-5.903273,"ele":1706.8},{"lat":42.990864,"lng":-5.903206,"ele":1708.1},{"lat":42.990889,"lng":-5.903152,"ele":1709.2},{"lat":42.990924