('wikiloc', '8545450', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/los-campanarios-santa-ana-8545450', 'Los Campanarios - Santa Ana', '{"en":"One way to Santa Ana","ca":"Un sol sentit a Santa Ana","es":"Un solo sentido a Santa Ana"}'::jsonb, 'los campanarios - santa ana Hiking trail in Fuente Dé, Cantabria (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Nombre: 2014-08-17 10:27Hora Inicio: 08/17/2014 10:27Hora Fin: 08/17/2014 15:38Distancia recorrida: 13,4 km (05:10)Tiempo en movimiento: 03:18Velocidad media: 2,6 km/hVel. en Mov.: 4 km/hVelocidad Máxima: 30 km/hAltura Mínima: 1609 mAltura Máxima: 2603 mVelocidad Ascenso: 564,4 m/hVelocidad Descenso: -681,3 m/hGanancia Altitud: 1352 mPérdida Altitud: -1449 mTiempo Ascenso: 02:23Tiempo Descenso: 02:07', '{"en":"This difficult one-way route from Fuente Dé ascends to Los Campanarios and Santa Ana, covering 13.4 km with 1045m of elevation gain. The trail reaches a maximum altitude of 2603m, offering a significant high-mountain experience.\n\nThe route involves a sustained ascent and descent, suitable for experienced hikers. Expect challenging terrain and a rewarding journey through the Picos de Europa.","ca":"Aquesta ruta difícil d''anada des de Fuente Dé ascendeix a Los Campanarios i Santa Ana, recorrent 13,4 km amb 1045m de desnivell positiu. El camí assoleix una altitud màxima de 2603m, oferint una experiència significativa d''alta muntanya.\n\nLa ruta implica un ascens i descens sostinguts, adequada per a excursionistes experimentats. Espereu un terreny desafiant i un viatge gratificant pels Picos de Europa.","es":"Esta ruta difícil de ida desde Fuente Dé asciende a Los Campanarios y Santa Ana, cubriendo 13,4 km con 1045m de desnivel positivo. El sendero alcanza una altitud máxima de 2603m, ofreciendo una experiencia significativa de alta montaña.\n\nLa ruta implica un ascenso y descenso sostenidos, adecuada para excursionistas experimentados. Espere un terreno desafiante y un viaje gratificante por los Picos de Europa."}'::jsonb, 'Oscar Parra Heras', 13406, 1045, 1110, 2583, 1601, 'difficult', 'one-way', NULL, 18600, 638, '2014-12-30', '2014-07', '[{"lat":43.16785,"lng":-4.787071,"ele":1668},{"lat":43.167656,"lng":-4.787077,"ele":1669},{"lat":43.167827,"lng":-4.787158,"ele":1669},{"lat":43.167817,"lng":-4.787408,"ele":1668.4},{"lat":43.167782,"lng":-4.787665,"ele":1668},{"lat":43.167751,"lng":-4.787924,"ele":1668.1},{"lat":43.167792,"lng":-4.788183,"ele":1666.9},{"lat":43.16788,"lng":-4.788421,"ele":1666.8},{"lat":43.167959,"lng":-4.788644,"ele":1668},{"lat":43.168018,"lng":-4.788886,"ele":1669.2},{"lat":43.168121,"lng":-4.789106,"ele":1670.1},{"lat":43.168238,"lng":-4.789321,"ele":1672.8},{"lat":43.168254,"lng":-4.789585,"ele":1675.3},{"lat":43.168237,"lng":-4.789848,"ele":1678},{"lat":43.168189,"lng":-4.790096,"ele":1680.7},{"lat":43.168167,"lng":-4.790342,"ele":1682.7},{"lat":43.168156,"lng":-4.790606,"ele":1685.1},{"lat":43.168177,"lng":-4.790861,"ele":1687.6},{"lat":43.168194,"lng":-4.791116,"ele":1690.1},{"lat":43.168222,"lng":-4.791366,"ele":1693.3},{"lat":43.168219,"lng":-4.791623,"ele":1696.7},{"lat":43.168232,"lng":-4.791886,"ele":1697.9},{"lat":43.168186,"lng":-4.792144,"ele":1697.9},{"lat":43.168116,"lng":-4.792396,"ele":1698.2},{"lat":43.168051,"lng":-4.792631,"ele":1700.1},{"lat":43.168062,"lng":-4.792877,"ele":1701.5},{"lat":43.16803,"lng":-4.793126,"ele":1704},{"lat":43.168008,"lng":-4.793378,"ele":1705.1},{"lat":43.167962,"lng":-4.793623,"ele":1707},{"lat":43.167909,"lng":-4.793863,"ele":1707.8},{"lat":43.167864,"lng":-4.79412,"ele":1709.3},{"lat":43.167861,"lng":-4.794374,"ele":1711.2},{"lat":43.167933,"lng":-4.7946,"ele":1713.6},{"lat":43.168006,"lng":-4.794841,"ele":1717.3},{"lat":43.168173,"lng":-4.794942,"ele":1719.2},{"lat":43.168346,"lng":-4.795041,"ele":1721},{"lat":43.168396,"lng":-4.795294,"ele":1721.4},{"lat":43.168341,"lng":-4.79553,"ele":1722.9},{"lat":43.168267,"lng":-4.795763,"ele":1725.7},{"lat":43.168352,"lng":-4.795981,"ele":17